frame: use checked arithmetic for the TOC group offsets and total size, and return an error from
adjust_offsets. On 32-bit targets a few maximum-size TOC entries wrap the offset accumulator, and
adjust_offsets panicked ("group offset is smaller than global frame offset"). Test:
toc_offset_overflow (crates/jxl-oxide-tests/tests/toc_offset_overflow.rs). The input only fails on
32-bit targets (upstream CI runs the tests on armv7).

Upstream: not reported; the code is unchanged at upstream HEAD (c0cc4c7, 2026-08-15).

